  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 04409aefae9d73241b9cdf59673ff866, type: 3}
  m_Name: InternalCorespondence_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pageNumber: 11
  noteTitle: 'Internal 3/4 '
  noteContent: "[Email] Subject: Query regarding overload capability. From: Prof.
    Aleksander Kowalski To: IT Department. Body: Greetings, I require information
    regarding the possibility of remotely or locally overloading the university's
    critical server system. This is purely a theoretical inquiry within the scope
    of my 'Digital Self Project' \u2013 I must anticipate emergency scenarios. Reply:
    RESPONSE FROM IT: We strongly advise against such actions. The risk of a cascading
    failure of security systems and infrastructure is extremely high. The procedure
    does not exist and cannot be initiated."
